        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c2_every_pair_tokens_interact_one",
          "text": "Every pair of tokens can interact in one layer through the inner product between their query and key embeddings, whereas a recurrent network must thread information through the sequence one step at a time.",
