          "chunk_id": "s03_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c4_bet_you_make_connection_between",
          "text": "The paper's bet is that if you can make the connection between attention layers and MPC rounds precise, you get a single lens that explains both what transformers can do and what they cannot.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
