          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_algorithmic_power_logarithmic_depth",
          "text": "So the algorithmic power of logarithmic-depth transformers is captured, up to constants, by the MPC model.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
