          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_instantly_gives_log_depth_transforme",
          "text": "That instantly gives log-depth transformers for classic parallel problems like graph connectivity, and, under a standard conjecture about MPC's limits, shows those constructions are near-optimal.",
