        {
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c1_heart_forward_simulation_routing_gad",
          "text": "The heart of the forward simulation is a routing gadget. In MPC, each round ends with machines sending addressed messages to one another, and the authors show a single self-attention layer can perform exactly this routing.",
